      "71": {
        "attributes": {
          "font-size": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 19
          },
          "text": {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "VIGNETTE\n\nThis node allows you to create a vignette around the incomming texture. Anything from a soft vingnette to a hard cut-off can be made. Note tht the vignette is in fact a reduction of the alpha channel. To create the traditional black vignette the signal is to be combined with a black background like done in this example."
          }
        },
